[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15840.59, "timestamp": "04:24:00", "text": "我得到了它。谢天谢地，我稍微修改了一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15849.83, "timestamp": "04:24:09", "text": "是星期五吗？看？是的，今天是星期四。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15851.59, "timestamp": "04:24:11", "text": "等等，我刚才说的是星期二吗？等等，等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15854.189, "timestamp": "04:24:14", "text": "等待。我说的是星期二，不是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15857.189, "timestamp": "04:24:17", "text": "我？啊，今天不是星期二。今天是星期四。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15863.149, "timestamp": "04:24:23", "text": "我的错。星期二是Kyobi。京美"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15867.67, "timestamp": "04:24:27", "text": "木井会在星期四。你好。第三个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15883.389, "timestamp": "04:24:43", "text": "早晨。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15887.03, "timestamp": "04:24:47", "text": "等待。等待。好的，订单就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15897.75, "timestamp": "04:24:57", "text": "鞋子将用于"}]